<!--
  colortest.midi.xml  –  Push 2 color palette tester for Mixxx
  Script: colortest-script.js  (functionprefix: CTEST)

  Lights all 64 pads with Push 2 palette colors.
    Page 1 (default)      : palette indices 0..63
    Page 2 (hold SHIFT)   : palette indices 64..127
  SHIFT = CC49 (0x31). Pressing any pad prints its index to the log.

  Pads are NoteOn Ch1 (0x90), notes 0x24..0x63 (8x8 grid, bottom-left=0x24).
-->
